          ],
          "sub_type": "flowchart",
          "content": "```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A[\"C6H5CH2CH2COOH\"] -->|\"SOCl2\"| B{\"?\"}\n  B -->|\"无水AlCl3\"| C[\"C10H14-CHO\"]\n  D[\"C2H5MgBr\"] --> E{\"??\"}\n  E -->|\"???\"| F[\"C10H14-C2H5\"]\n  A -.-> D\n```",
          "captions": [],
